  "description": "The hook-shaped top of the ramps seamlessly attaches to the trailer's rear, providing a stable and non-slip platform for loading and unloading. The raised slope texture and sturdy feet further enhance the ramps' functionality and safety.\nFitment\nEasily and safely load ATVs, UTVs, pickups, push mowers, and dirt bikes with these robust aluminum ramps. Their lightweight design and impressive weight capacity ensure a secure and efficient loading experience.\nFeatures\nLightweight Aluminum: Made of premium aluminum; The Trailer Ramps are sturdy and make moving the vehicle a breeze; Lighter than steel, suitable for carrying, and long service life\n6000 lb Load Capacity: Easily and safely move ATVs, UTVs, pickups, push mowers, and dirt bikes; This pair of aluminum ramps is lightweight yet strong enough to load and hold heavy equipment\nSecure Loading & Unloading: The car trailer ramps feature a hook-shaped top that attaches well to the rear of the trailer; Raised slope texture and feet achieve non-slip functionality\nIncludes: 2 aluminum trailer ramps, each ramp length 84 inches; Width: 14 inches; Total weight: 54 pounds\nTips: Do not exceed the maximum load of the ramp; Load the vehicle on a flat and hard surface; Heavy-duty aluminum construction for many years of reliable loading",
